]{4}){3,7}\\\\b\\"\\nCLS-PHI-MED-ID-001 PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER prio2 0.90 r\\"\\\\b(?:MC|MEM|PAT|REC)-[A-Za-z0-9-]{4,15}\\\\b\\"\\nCLS-PII-IP-001 PII.LOCATION.IP_ADDRESS prio3 0.90 ip pattern (standard dotted-quad + ipv6)\\nCLS-PII-DOB-001 PII.DEMOGRAPHIC.DATE_OF_BIRTH prio3 0.85 r\\"\\\\b(?:19|20)\\\\d{2}-(?:0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|3[01])\\\\b|\\\\b(?:January|February|March|April|May|June|July|August|September|October|November|December)\\\\s+(?:0?[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|3[01]),\\\\s+(?:19|20)\\\\d{2}\\\\b\\"\\nCLS-PII-PASSPORT-001 PII.IDENTIFIER.PASSPORT prio3 0.85 r\\"\\\\b[A-Z]\\\\d{8,9}\\\\b\\"\\nCLS-PII-DL-001 PII.IDENTIFIER.DRIVERS_LICENSE prio3 0.85 r\\"\\\\bDL-[A-Z0-9]{6,12}(?:-[A-Z]{2})?\\\\b\\"\\nCLS-PII-ADDRESS-001 PII.LOCATION.STREET_ADDRESS prio4 0.85 r\\"\\\\b\\\\d{1,5}\\\\s+[A-Za-z0-9\\\\s.,]+(?:Terrace|Street|St|Avenue|Ave|Road|Rd|Boulevard|Blvd|Way|Lane|Ln|Drive|Dr)(?:[A-Za-z0-9\\\\s.,#]+)?(?:,\\\\s+[A-Za-z\\\\s]+,\\\\s+[A-Z]{2}\\\\s+\\\\d{5}(?:-\\\\d{4})?)?\\\\b\\"\\nDictionary CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001 PHI.HEALTH_DATA prio3 0.85 word-bounded, case-sensitive terms: penicillin allergy, allergy, Hypertension, hypertension, prescription adjustment, emergency dispensation, medical dispensation\\nNER CLS-PII-NAME-001 PII.PERSON_NAME prio5 0.80 PERSON only.\\n\\nFor the PERSON NER proxy: search the FULL document with re.finditer over a pattern for Title-case name sequences of 2-4 tokens (r\\"\\\\b[A-Z][a-z]+(?:\\\\s+[A-Z][a-z]+){1,3}\\\\b\\") to enumerate candidates, print ALL candidates with absolute offsets, then accept as PERSON only the candidate immediately following a \\"Full Name:\\" label (same line, absolute span). Mark the rest as rejected-by-context (not emitted) with reason.\\n\\nThen: dedupe identical (start,end,classifier_id). Sort candidates by (start asc, length desc, priority asc, confidence desc). Greedy non-overlap. Output final spans with absolute offsets, matched text (raw and repr), category, classifier_id, confidence, priority, sugg