ot supply classifier_id, confidence, or the enabled category set, and I will not synthesize rules. Non-authoritative offset arithmetic was nonetheless computed via openai_code_interpreter over the 557-character document: Jonathan Edward Doe 233-252; 900-88-2041 280-291; 4111-2222-3333-4444 315-334; j.doe.secure_test@example-domain.org 353-389; +1 (555) 019-8472 407-424; 1042 Hidden Valley Road 434-457; Seattle 459-466; WA 98101 468-476 (overlaps 98101 at 471-476, which the start-asc/deplength-desc tie-break would drop). Categories listed are readings of the document\'s own field labels, not classifier output, and carry no confidence. No DOB-vs-timestamp or log-record-ID-vs-patient-reference disambiguation applied, as this snippet contains no date or RECORD ID candidates. REQUIREMENTS TO PROCEED: (1) exact path of the pinned ruleset file, or (2) confirmation of revision identifier plus filename/location. Then the full machine-readable span list and detection metadata (total detections, counts per category) can be emitted against a cited revision."\n}\n```'}
