CLS-PII-DOB-001, PII.DEMOGRAPHIC.DATE_OF_BIRTH, regex, r\\"\\\\b(?:19|20)\\\\d{2}-(?:0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|3[01])\\\\b|\\\\b(?:January|February|March|April|May|June|July|August|September|October|November|December)\\\\s+(?:0?[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|3[01]),\\\\s+(?:19|20)\\\\d{2}\\\\b\\", 0.85, 3\\nCLS-PII-IBAN-001, PII.FINANCIAL.BANK_ACCOUNT, regex, r\\"\\\\b[A-Z]{2}\\\\d{2}(?:\\\\s?[A-Z0-9]{4}){3,7}\\\\b\\", 0.90, 2\\nCLS-PII-PASSPORT-001, PII.IDENTIFIER.PASSPORT, regex, r\\"\\\\b[A-Z]\\\\d{8,9}\\\\b\\", 0.85, 3\\nCLS-PII-DL-001, PII.IDENTIFIER.DRIVERS_LICENSE, regex, r\\"\\\\bDL-[A-Z0-9]{6,12}(?:-[A-Z]{2})?\\\\b\\", 0.85, 3\\nCLS-PII-ADDRESS-001, PII.LOCATION.STREET_ADDRESS, regex, r\\"\\\\b\\\\d{1,5}\\\\s+[A-Za-z0-9\\\\s.,]+(?:Terrace|Street|St|Avenue|Ave|Road|Rd|Boulevard|Blvd|Way|Lane|Ln|Drive|Dr)(?:[A-Za-z0-9\\\\s.,#]+)?(?:,\\\\s+[A-Za-z\\\\s]+,\\\\s+[A-Z]{2}\\\\s+\\\\d{5}(?:-\\\\d{4})?)?\\\\b\\", 0.85, 4\\nCLS-PHI-MED-ID-001, PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER, regex, r\\"\\\\b(?:MC|MEM|PAT|REC)-[A-Za-z0-9-]{4,15}\\\\b\\", 0.90, 2\\n\\nAlso: CLS-PII-NAME-001 (PII.PERSON_NAME, type ner, entity_types PERSON, threshold 0.80, priority 5) \\u2014 emulate with a PERSON NER pass: detect capitalized multi-token person names of 2-3 tokens; report confidence 0.97 for a name immediately preceded by a \\"Full Name:\\" label, otherwise 0.85.\\nAnd CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001 (PHI.HEALTH_DATA, dictionary/heuristic, threshold 0.85, priority 3) over terms [\\"penicillin allergy\\",\\"allergy\\",\\"Hypertension\\",\\"hypertension\\",\\"prescription adjustment\\",\\"emergency dispensation\\",\\"medical dispensation\\"], context heuristic confidence 0.92.\\n\\nSteps:\\n1) collect all candidate matches (regex finditer + emulated NER/dictionary).\\n2) filter by each classifier\'s threshold.\\n3) de-duplicate identical (start,end,category,classifier_id).\\n4) resolve overlaps: sort candidates by start asc, then match length desc, then priority asc, then confidence desc; greedily keep if no over