ress | PII.LOCATION.STREET_ADDRESS | regex | 0.85 | 4 | [STREET_ADDRESS] |\n| CLS-PII-NAME-001 | Full Name / Individual Name | PII.PERSON_NAME | ner (PERSON) | 0.80 | 5 | [NAME] |\n| CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001 | Medical Case Ref / Patient Member ID | PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER | regex | 0.90 | 2 | [MEDICAL_ID] |\n| CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001 | Health Condition / Prescription / Allergy | PHI.HEALTH_DATA | dictionary_and_heuristic | 0.85 | 3 | [HEALTH_DATA] |\n\nCategories covered: PII (subcategories PERSON_NAME, IDENTIFIER, CONTACT, LOCATION, FINANCIAL, DEMOGRAPHIC) and PHI (MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER, HEALTH_DATA).\n\n```json\n{\n  "Name": "master_data_classifiers_ruleset_registry",\n  "Inquiry": "What is the current pinned revision of the ruleset and which classifiers are enabled in it?",\n  "Mode": "Determine",\n  "Relevant": "Yes",\n  "Strength": 10,\n  "Claim": "All",\n  "Requirements": "None"\n}\n```'}
