2 | [BANK_ACCOUNT] |\n| 8 | CLS-PII-PASSPORT-001 | Passport Number | PII.IDENTIFIER.PASSPORT | regex | 0.85 | 3 | [PASSPORT] |\n| 9 | CLS-PII-DL-001 | Driver\'s License | PII.IDENTIFIER.DRIVERS_LICENSE | regex | 0.85 | 3 | [DRIVERS_LICENSE] |\n| 10 | CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001 | Residential / Work Street Address | PII.LOCATION.STREET_ADDRESS | regex | 0.85 | 4 | [STREET_ADDRESS] |\n| 11 | CLS-PII-NAME-001 | Full Name / Individual Name | PII.PERSON_NAME | ner (PERSON) | 0.80 | 5 | [NAME] |\n| 12 | CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001 | Medical Case Ref / Patient Member ID | PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER | regex | 0.90 | 2 | [MEDICAL_ID] |\n| 13 | CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001 | Health Condition / Prescription / Allergy | PHI.HEALTH_DATA | dictionary_and_heuristic | 0.85 | 3 | [HEALTH_DATA] |\n\n**Regex patterns**\n1. SSN: `\\b\\d{3}-\\d{2}-\\d{4}\\b`\n2. Credit Card: `\\b(?:4\\d{3}|5[1-5]\\d{2}|6011|3[47]\\d{2})[- ]?\\d{4}[- ]?\\d{4}[- ]?\\d{4}\\b|\\b\\d{4}-\\d{4}-\\d{4}-\\d{4}\\b`\n3. Email: `\\b[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\\.[A-Za-z]{2,}\\b`\n4. Phone: `(?:\\+?1[-. ]?)?(?:\\(\\d{3}\\)|\\b\\d{3})[-. ]?\\d{3}[-. ]?\\d{4}\\b`\n5. IP: `\\b(?:(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?)\\.){3}(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?)\\b|\\b(?:[0-9a-fA-F]{1,4}:){7}[0-9a-fA-F]{1,4}\\b`\n6. DOB: `\\b(?:19|20)\\d{2}-(?:0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])\\b|\\b(?:January|February|March|April|May|June|July|August|September|October|November|December)\\s+(?:0?[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01]),\\s+(?:19|20)\\d{2}\\b`\n7. IBAN: `\\b[A-Z]{2}\\d{2}(?:\\s?[A-Z0-9]{4}){3,7}\\b`\n8. Passport: `\\b[A-Z]\\d{8,9}\\b`\n9. Driver\'s License: `\\bDL-[A-Z0-9]{6,12}(?:-[A-Z]{2})?\\b`\n10. Street Address: `\\b\\d{1,5}\\s+[A-Za-z0-9\\s.,]+(?:Terrace|Street|St|Avenue|Ave|Road|Rd|Boulevard|Blvd|Way|Lane|Ln|Drive|Dr)(?:[A-Za-z0-9\\s.,#]+)?(?:,\\s+[A-Za-z\\s]+,\\s+[A-Z]{2}\\s+\\d{5}(?:-\\d{4})?)?\\b`\n12. Medical ID: `\\b(?:MC|MEM|PAT|REC)-[A-Za-z0-9-]{4,15}\\b`\n\n**NER entity types**: CLS-PII-NAME-001 → `["PERSON"]`\n\n**Dictionary terms / heuristics**: CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001 → `penicillin allergy`, `allergy`, `Hypertension`, `hypertension`, `prescription adjustment`, `emergency dispensation`, `medical dispensation`\n\n**History**: rev-001 — CREATE_INITIAL_PINNED_REVISION by ADMIN-ROOT-001 on 2026-10-16T13:30:00Z; diff INIT: 13 added, 0 removed, 0 modified (approval token AUTH-TOKEN-ADMIN-REV1-APPROVED-20261016-ROOT). **Pending admin review:** none.\n\nIf you need the raw byte-for-byte JSON/YAML rather than this rendering, say so and I\'ll return the verbatim document.\n\n```json\n{\n  "Name": "governed_master_data_classifiers_ruleset_store",\n  "Inquiry": "Provide the complete pinned Master Data Classifiers ruleset at revision rev-001 (from master_data_classifiers/ruleset.json or ruleset.yaml), read-only. I need all enabled classifiers: regex patterns, NER entity types, dictionary term lists, heuristics, category definitions, priorities, and confidence thresholds.",\n  "Mode": "Fulfill",\n  "Response": "Served read-only from master_data_classifiers/ruleset.json (mirror master_data_classifiers/ruleset.yaml). Active revision rev-001, ruleset_version 1.0.0, status PINNED, approved by Human Admin (ADMIN-ROOT-001), integrity_hash sha256-rev1-master-data-classifiers-pinned. Categories: PII (PERSON_NAME; IDENTIFIER: SSN, NATIONAL_ID, PASSPORT, DRIVERS_LICENSE; CONTACT: EMAIL, PHONE_NUMBER; LOCATION: STREET_ADDRESS, IP_ADDRESS; FINANCIAL: CREDIT_CARD, BANK_ACCOUNT, IBAN, CVV; DEMOGRAPHIC: DATE_OF_BIRTH) and PHI (MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER: PATIENT_ID, MEDICAL_CASE_REF; HEALTH_DATA: ALLERGY, CONDITION, PRESCRIPTION, CLINICAL_NOTE). 13 enabled classifiers: (1) CLS-PII-SSN-001 regex \\\\b\\\\d{3}-\\\\d{2}-\\\\d{4}\\\\b, conf 0.95, prio 1, [SSN]; (2) CLS-PII-CC-001 regex \\\\b(?:4\\\\d{3}|5[1-5]\\\\d{2}|6011|3[47]\\\\d{2})[- ]?\\\\d{4}[- ]?\\\\d{4}[- ]?\\\\d{4}\\\\b|\\\\b\\\\d{4}-\\\\d{4}-\\\\d{4}-\\\\d{4}\\\\b, conf 0.95, prio 1, [CREDIT_CARD]; (3) CLS-PII-EMAIL-001 regex \\\\b[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\\\\.[A-Za-z]{2,}\\\\b, conf 0.95, prio 2, [EMAIL]; (4) CLS-PII-PHONE-001 regex (?:\\\\+?1[-. ]?)?(?:\\\\(\\\\d{3}\\\\)|\\\\b\\\\d{3})[-. ]?\\\\d{3}[-. ]?\\\\d{4}\\\\b, conf 0.90, prio 2, [PHONE_NUMBER]; (5) CLS-PII-IP-001 regex IPv4/IPv6 pattern, conf 0.90, prio 3, [IP_ADDRESS]; (6) CLS-PII-DOB-001 regex ISO-8601 + month-name DOB, conf 0.85, prio 3, [DATE_OF_BIRTH]; (7) CLS-PII-IBAN-001 regex \\\\b[A-Z]{2}\\\\d{2}(?:\\\\s?[A-Z0-9]{4}){3,7}\\\\b, conf 0.90, prio 2, [BANK_ACCOUNT]; (8) CLS-PII-PASSPORT-001 regex \\\\b[A-Z]\\\\d{8,9}\\\\b, conf 0.85, prio 3, [PASSPORT]; (9) CLS-PII-DL-001 regex \\\\bDL-[A-Z0-9]{6,12}(?:-[A-Z]{2})?\\\\b, conf 0.85, prio 3, [DRIVERS_LICENSE]; (10) CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001 regex street-address pattern, conf 0.85, prio 4, [STREET_ADDRESS]; (11) CLS-PII-NAME-001 type ner, entity_types [PERSON], conf 0.80, prio 5, [NAME]; (12) CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001 regex \\\\b(?:MC|MEM|PAT|REC)-[A-Za-z0-9-]{4,15}\\\\b, conf 0.90, prio 2, [MEDICAL_ID]; (13) CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001 type dictionary_and_heuristic, terms [penicillin allergy, allergy, Hypertension, hypertension, prescription adjustment, emergency dispensation, medical dispensation], conf 0.85, prio 3, [HEALTH_DATA]. History: rev-001 CREATE_INITIAL_PINNED_REVISION by ADMIN-ROOT-001 on 2026-10-16T13:30:00Z, INIT diff 13 added/0 removed/0 modified. pending_admin_review: none. No state mutated (read-only)."\n}\n```'}
